  "body": "After years of enjoying this wonderful home, the owners have retired and are ready to embrace the next chapter of their lives. With a genuine commitment to selling, this is an excellent opportunity for buyers looking for a property in this highly sought-after location.\r\n\r\nSet on a generous 672sqm freehold site in Browns Bay,  this well-positioned home offers a wonderful combination of space, privacy and future potential.\r\n\r\nSurrounded by established fruit trees, the property enjoys a peaceful and private setting, while the large backyard provides plenty of room for families to enjoy — and potentially offers an opportunity to add an additional dwelling ( subject to Council approval).\r\n\r\nThe home features three bedrooms and one bathroom upstairs, while downstairs offers an additional space that could be used as a home office , together with a separate toilet and laundry. This flexible layout provides plenty of options for growing families, working from home or extended family living.\r\n\r\nThe location is hard to beat. Sherwood Reserve is within easy walking distance, while the motorway, Albany Shopping Centre and Browns Bay Beach are all just a few minutes’ drive away.\r\n\r\nFamilies will also appreciate the schooling options, with the property zoned for Sherwood Primary School, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College.\r\n\r\nWith the owners relocating, this is a genuine opportunity to secure a substantial full site in a sought-after location with plenty of future potential.\r\n\r\nLarge land. Great location. Endless possibilities — don’t miss it!",
